Rolls-Royce TotalCare enables predictive maintenance on jet engines through IoT sensors collecting data from hundreds of onboard monitors and cloud analytics using Microsoft Azure IoT Suite. The service detects anomalies in pump performance, fuel efficiency, and operational patterns, enabling proactive maintenance scheduling before failures occur. By shifting revenue from transactional overhauls to continuous fleet availability, Rolls-Royce extended average engine life 2x over 20 years while reducing downtime and lifecycle costs through data-driven condition monitoring.